{"title":"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of distinct points common to the graphs of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/e/d5e821d6f290f970c8a2e8ea86f9f73b6f13f528.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2+y^2=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"90\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/f/c9f1fb2e3784608240ed2621030a867f410df3cd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2=9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/1/10198c0a31454ddde998bff9b14c23fea0ea627d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\text{infinitely many}\\qquad \\textbf{(B) }\\text{four}\\qquad \\textbf{(C) }\\text{two}\\qquad \\textbf{(D) }\\text{one}\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }\\text{none}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"533\" height=\"18\" />    \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Solve the second equation by taking the square root of both sides.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/715fa800dddcafe15e3bd2137c512bb4f2c633e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y^2=9\\]\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/9/9e9acc628d38bf809f81fd5e72278e8e4733e8bb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[y=\\pm3\\]\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>Solve the first equation by substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/a/f5a3faa3658bcbd8bde8e16cfa5baf019619fc9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" /> into the first equation then solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/6/676c5b1c1338f5018af042f659e6645f68906e85.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2+9=9\\]\" width=\"81\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/d/25d30d448342ef96ce0ef6fcd5531c1362d6b6d4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2=0\\]\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/e/5/0e5065ea42e71241d1571fd868bae3267c53d818.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=0\\]\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>The two solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/b/b3b8eb8e093d1d1c3834d880a7b448b3fa76eeab.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/3/073525bcf565b508e59df21b9761303709eb10ef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,-3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"52\" height=\"18\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME\" title=\"1960 AHSME\">1960 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1960 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1960\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">Problem 6</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1960_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1960 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wi